$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2,4-Diamino-5-(furan-2-yl)-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (8a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2,4-diamino-5-iodo-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2729 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol),
furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125 mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 0.036 mmol), and TPPTS (53 mg, 0.093 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the mixture was
neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and concentrated to dryness in vacuo, and
the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in
water) to afford 8a which was crystallized from water. 2,4-Diamino-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-3-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (8d).
Compound 8d was prepared as described for 8a from 27 (283 mg, 0.695 mmol)
and thiophene-3-boronic acid as a white solid (222 mg, 88%), which was
crystallized from water/MeOH Mp 230-232 °C. [α ]D -53.0 (c 0.479, DMSO).
1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.50 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´a,OH = 6.1
Hz, J5´ a,4´ = 4.0 Hz, H-5´a); 3.59 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ b,OH =
5.0 Hz, J5´ b,4´ = 4.0 Hz, H-5´b); 3.84 (btd, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b =
3.9 Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 3.2 Hz, H-4´); 4.05 (td, 1H, J3´ ,2´ = J3´,OH = 4.8 Hz,
J3´ ,4´ = 3.2 Hz, H-3'); 4.36 (td, 1H, J2´ ,1´ = J2´,OH = 6.4, J2´ ,3´ =
5.2 Hz, H-2'); 5.05 (d, 1H, JOH,3´ = 4.5 Hz, OH-3´); 5.16 (bt, 1H,
JOH,5´a = JOH,5´b = 5.6 Hz, OH-5´); 5.24 (d, 1H, JOH,2´ = 6.3 Hz, OH-2´);
5.74 (bs, 2H, NH2-2); 5.79 (bs, 2H, NH2-4); 5.96 (d, 1H, J1´,2´ = 6.5 Hz,
H-1'); 7.09 (s, 1H, H-6); 7.23 (dd, 1H, J4,5 = 4.9 Hz, J4,2 = 1.3 Hz,
H-4-thienyl); 7.43 (dd, 1H, J2,5 = 2.9 Hz, J2,4 = 1.3 Hz, H-4-thienyl);
7.67 (dd, 1H, J5,4 = 4.9 Hz, J5,2 = 2.9 Hz, H-5-thienyl). 13C NMR (125.7
MHz, DMSO-d6): 61.98 (CH2-5´); 70.83 (CH-3'); 73.46 (CH-2'); 84.83
(CH-4´); 86.36 (CH-1´); 94.71 (C-4a); 111.59 (C-5); 117.28 (CH-6); 121.16
(CH-2-thienyl); 127.21 (CH-5-thienyl); 128.47 (CH-4-thienyl); 135.82
(C-3-thienyl); 153.84 (C-7a); 158.02 (C-4); 159.94 (C-2). IR (ATR): ν
1600, 1573, 1446, 1410, 1106, 1057, 1017, 994, 856, 790, 778 cm-1. MS
(ESI) m/z 364 (M+H), 386 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C15H18N5O4S [M+H] calcd:
364.10740; found: 364.10730. Anal. (C15H17N5O4S): C, H, N.
