$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM N-(((3S,3aS)-1-oxo-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1,3,3a,4-tetrahydrobenzo[b]oxazolo[3,4-d][1,4]oxazin-3-yl)methyl)acetamide
(34). A mixture of 5 (1.0 g, 2.93 mmol), bis(pinacolato)diboron (0.89 g,
3.52 mmol), potassium acetate (0.86 g, 8.79 mmol) and
1,1-[bis-(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene]dichloropalladium(II)
dichloromethane complex (0.24 g, 0.29 mmol) in DMSO (16 mL) was degassed
and flushed with argon. The mixture was hearted at 80 °C for 1 h. Ethyl
acetate (150 mL) was added, and the mixture was filtered through Celite,
washed with saturated brine, dried over sodium sulfate, and evaporated.
The dark residue was purified by chromatography on silica gel with
petroleum/ ethyl acetate (1:1) to give 34. Light pink solid, yield 1 g,
87.9%. Mp: 162-164 °C. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.95 (dd, J1 = 1.71 Hz,
J2 = 7.82 Hz, 1 H), 6.92-7.10 (m, 2 H), 6.57 (br s, 1 H), 4.53 (dd, J1 =
2.44 Hz, J2 = 10.01 Hz, 1 H), 4.42 (m, 1 H), 3.96 (dd, J1 = 2.44 Hz, J2 =
6.84 Hz, 1 H), 3.88 (t, J = 10.01 Hz, 1 H), 3.80 (m, 2 H), 2.05 (s, 3 H),
1.24 (s, 12 H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 171.1, 153.2, 143.6, 128.3,
125.3, 123.2, 118.0, 83.9 (2 C, overlap), 75.2, 66.1, 53.03, 41.1, 24.8
(4 C, overlap), 23.1. MS (ESI) m/z: 389.3 (M+1)+. HRMS (ESI): Anal. Calcd
for C19H25BN2O6: 388.1806, Found: 388.1804.
