$DATUM Methyl 2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-6-(4-(5'''''-methyl-3', 3'',3''',
3'''',3''''-pentahexyl-2,2':5',2'':5'',2''':5''',2'''':5'''',2'''''-sexithiophen-5-yl)-1H-1,2,3-triazol-1-yl)hexanoate
(2) A solution of 15 (0.86 g, 1.01 mmol), 23 (0.71 g, 1.1 mmol) and CsCO3
(0.99 g, 3.0 mmol) in toluene (30 mL) was degassed for 10 min. Pd(PPh3)4
(0.06 g, 0.05 mmol) was then added and the solution refluxed vigorously
overnight. The resulting solution was diluted with EtOAc, filtered and
concentrated in vacuo. The resulting residue was purified via column
chromatography (SiO2, n-hexane, 50% EtOAc) followed by recrystallization
from ethanol to give 2 (1.1 g, 0.88 mmol, 87% yield) as a red solid. m.p.
90 - 93 °C; Rf 0.43 (EtOAc, 50% n-hexane); IR (KBr) 3383, 3111, 2955,
2926, 2855, 1758, 1689, 1508, 1454, 1365, 1222, 1164 cm-1; 1H NMR (CDCl3)
δ 7.68 (s, 1H), 7.33 (d, J= 4.0 Hz, 1H), 7.11 (d, J= 4.0 Hz, 1H), 6.99
(s, 1H), 6.97 (s, 1H), 6.95 (s, 1H), 6.87 (s, 1H), 6.59 (d, J= 1.0 Hz,
1H), 5.04 (d, J= 8.0 Hz, 1H), 4.40 (t, J= 7.0 Hz, 2H), 4.32 (m, 1H), 3.74
(s, 3H), 2.88 - 2.74 (m, 8H), 2.74 - 2.66 (m, 2H), 2.44 (d, J= 0.5 Hz,
3H), 2.09 - 1.81 (m, 2H), 1.77 - 1.57 (m, 10H), 1.52 - 1.24 (m, 43H),
0.99 - 0.81 (m, 15H); 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 172.9, 155.3, 142.7, 140.10,
139.94, 139.85, 139.7, 139.6, 138.0, 135.6, 134.5, 134.0, 133.9, 133.8,
132.6, 130.3, 130.3, 130.2, 129.7, 128.5, 128.4, 128.1, 128.0, 126.1,
124.3, 118.8, 80.0, 77.3, 77.0, 76.7, 52.9, 52.4, 50.1, 32.2, 31.7, 30.6,
30.51, 30.47, 30.46, 29.7, 29.43, 29.41, 29.40, 29.37, 29.2, 28.3, 22.6,
22.3, 15.3, 14.1; HRMS (ESI): calcd for C69H98N4O432S6: 1238.5912, found:
1238.5935; αD22= +7.2 (c=1.0, CHCl3); elemental analysis calcd (%) for
C69H98N4O4S6: C 66.8, H 8.0, N 4.4, S 15.5; found: C 66.7, H 8.0, N 4.6,
S 15.25.
