$DATUM N-(3-(5-Chloro-2-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridin-3-yl)benzyl)methanesulfonamide
(16a) To a stirred suspension of
N-(3-(5-chloro-2-iodo-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridin-3-yl)benzyl)methanesulfonamide
(57 mg, 0.123 mmol) and
1-methyl-4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazole
(27.0 mg, 0.130 mmol) in toluene (0.78 mL), EtOH (0.223 mL) and 2M Na2CO3
aqueous (0.111 mL) was added PdCl2(dppf)⋅CH2Cl2 (5.0 mg, 0.006 mmol). The
reaction was heated to 80 °C for 18 h before cooling to ambient
temperature. Once cooled the reaction was concentrated in vacuo then dry
loaded onto silica. Purification was accomplished by flash chromatography
on silica gel eluting with MeOH/CH2Cl2 (5%) to yield the title compound
(47 mg) as an off-white solid. Further purification by recrystallisation
(CH2Cl2/MeOH), The title compound (34 mg, 66%) as an off-white solid
along with the title compound from the evaporated filtrate (10 mg, 20%)
as a pale yellow soild. 1H-NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6) 2.91 (s, 3H, -SO2CH3),
3.85 (s, 3H, -NCH3), 4.25 (d, J = 6.2 Hz, 2H, -CH2-), 7.37 (app t, J =
7.1 Hz, 2H, CHar), 7.45-7.51 (m, 2H, CHar), 7.63 (t, J = 6.3 Hz, 1H,
-CH2NH-), 7.65 (br s, 1H, CHar), 7.76 (d, J = 2.3 Hz, 1H, CHar), 7.87 (br
s, 1H, CHar), 8.21 (d, J = 2.3 Hz, 1H, CHar), 12.23 (br s, 1H, -CNHC-);
HRMS: Found 438.0767; calculated for C19H18ClN5O2SNa (M+Na)+: 438.0762.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM chemoselective, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
