$DATUM tert-Butyl(trans-4-{[3-(2-Aminopyrimidin-5-yl)imidazo[1,2-b]-pyridazin-6-yl]amino}cyclohexyl)carbamate
5. A mixture of 4 (1.20 g, 2.92 mmol, 1.0 equiv),
2-aminopyrimidine-5-boronic acid pinacol ester (970 mg, 4.39 mmol, 1.5
equiv), Cs2CO3 (3.81 g, 11.7 mmol, 4.0 equiv), water (6 mL), and dioxane
(12 mL) was degassed with N2, then Pd(dppf)Cl2 (238 mg, 0.29 mmol, 0.1
equiv) was added, and the mixture heated at 90 °C for 5 h. The mixture
was allowed to cool, then concentrated to dryness and purified by
chromatography on silica gel (2-20% MeOH/EtOAc) to give 5. Bieige solid,
yield 1.07 g, 86%. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ ppm 8.96 (s, 2H), 7.78 (s,
1H), 7.70 (d, J = 9.6 Hz, 1H), 6.96 (d, J = 6.9 Hz, 1H), 6.87-6.78 (m,
3H), 6.62 (d, J = 9.6 Hz, 1H), 3.52-3.42 (m, 1H), 3.30-3.21 (m, 1H),
2.17-2.08 (m, 2H), 1.90-1.79 (m, 2H), 1.38 (s, 9H), 1.32-1.21 (m, 4H).
m/z (ES + APCI)+: 425 [M + H]+.
