$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-Bromo-5-chloropyridin-3-amine (2.00 g, 9.71 mmol) was reacted with
potassium furan-2-yltrifluoroborate (2.50 g, 14.4 mmol) for 6 h at 80 °C
as described in the first step of 1e synthesis. The product was purified
by flash chromatography with EtOAc-DCM-hexane (1:1:8); yield
5-chloro-2-(furan-2-yl)pyridin-3-amine. Yellow crystalline, yield 1.62 g
86%. Mp 107- 108 °C,. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.98 (d, J = 2.0, 1H),
7.55 (dd, J = 1.8, 0.8, 1H), 7.0-6.99 (m, 2H), 6.57 (dd, J = 3.5, 1.8,
1H), 4.75 (s, 2H); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 153.8, 142.3, 140.0, 137.8,
132.5, 130.5, 122.9, 112.0, 109.5; HRMS (EI) calcd for C9H7N2ClO
194.0247, found 194.0244.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
